# speaker: Chemy
# speaker: Tidus
Welcome to Wavecrest! You must be Chemy from the Alchemist Association, yes?
# speaker: Chemy
That's me! It's nice to finally be here.

# speaker: Tidus
Ohoho, Greetings to you Lass. My name is Tidus and I am the mayor of Wavecrest. 

# speaker: Tidus
The Alchemist Association sent me a letter saying you'd be staying on A'ea for a while.

# speaker: Chemy
Yes! I'll be studying the local flora and fauna. I'm so excited to explore Wavecrest! 

# speaker: Tidus
Ohoho! Do tell me about some stories of the outside from time to time.

# speaker: Chemy
Sure! I'll be happy to share some stories with you Mr. Tidus! I'm looking forward to making new stories here in A'ea too.

# speaker: Tidus
I'll get to tourin' quick now.
#func: teleport@-63.5327225,348.230896,-223.999283
#func: setlook@46.5993
# speaker: Tidus
This here behind me is the port you just came from and right next to my house too.

# speaker: Tidus
On the cliff over there is the light house, where our unlucky old lad Sven lives.

#func: teleport@-125.076096,348.128174,-112.423645
#func: setlook@28.62199
# speaker: Tidus
Next to it, this here is the local Farm run by Kenneth and his brothers.

#func: teleport@-127.420807,347.667908,-249.288849
#func: setlook@-173.8873
# speaker: Tidus
Over here, this is the post office, Poshe practically lives there.

#func: teleport@-18.9291191,347.548431,-340.904266
#func: setlook@-130.0804
# speaker: Tidus
This here is Mr. Ramonts' Inn. Cozy place here, I was going to place you right here, but I found a better place for you.

# speaker: Tidus
Your new abode is just outside town, near Breezewood Forest. Perfect place for you, Lass. 

#func: teleport@-105.637032,348.313568,-369.94693
#func: setlook@-157.201
# speaker: Tidus
Here we are. Just like a mutton dressed as lamb this one.

# speaker: Tidus
It's a modest little cottage, but it has everything you'll need. The previous alchemist left behind some of their equipment here as well. But, if you ever need more furniture just knock some coins on me and I'll arrange it to be delivered straight here!

# speaker: Chemy
It's wonderful! Thank you for preparing everything.

# speaker: Tidus
Don't mind it. Least I could do really.

# speaker: Tidus
Get some rest, I'm sure the ride was a bumpy one.

# speaker: Chemy
I will. Thank you, Mayor Tidus.

# speaker: Chemy
...

# speaker: Chemy
Phew... I still feel a little dizzy from the ride here.

# speaker: Chemy
I should be able to make a Nausea Relief Potion with a few simple ingredients.

# speaker: Chemy
# func: givequest@quest_chemy_nauseareliefpotion
Mayor Tidus mentioned Breezewood Forest was nearby. It should be a good place to start gathering.

# speaker: Chemy
Time to head into the forest.
